{"id": "EUVD-2026-86911", "enisaUuid": "3e468f29-4cf4-31df-a856-9a73431ba2b5", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nbtrfs: zoned: finish active block group cleanup if call_zone_finish() fails\n\ndo_zone_finish() clears BLOCK_GROUP_FLAG_ZONE_IS_ACTIVE before finishing\nthe zones. If call_zone_finish() then fails it returned early, leaving the\nnow inactive block group on fs_info->zone_active_bgs, leaking its\nreference, the BTRFS_FS_NEED_ZONE_FINISH waiters are never woken, and as\nits alloc_offset equals the zone capacity btrfs_zone_finish_one_bg() keeps\nselecting it, spinning btrfs_zoned_activate_one_bg().\n\nFall through to the cleanup on failure too and return the error, but keep\nthe block group read-only as its zones are left inconsistent.", "datePublished": "2026-09-25T10:24:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:54:24", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/433d52b196a689b18dcfadc7cf6c784f0e5cc7c9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36b9cdab44848f25879ca625275c92b007f84653", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/40370f02a1ca3760f8925ffcbe76eb4d91ea758d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e1b168a53174b385e3548bfbd079513b22ac240c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a18a6b93a2843b9d103d3456bbd4b3f90282a379"], "aliases": ["GHSA-vxgx-5rhh-g7hj", "CVE-2026-98081"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "13b02b04-d3c7-3e30-8665-9060ae980cae", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "15d1cd90-b7b6-3256-bd16-91e2d8f620c0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.53"}, {"id": "2a5c6409-3caf-3c5a-94ad-cf8852c24d05", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d70cbdda75da3f258118a558c087157e073229fb <e1b168a53174b385e3548bfbd079513b22ac240c"}, {"id": "2c542682-ad2c-35e7-a14b-05171939d9c4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "2f78c496-990c-383c-8b7a-6bc45f70509a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "6f4db208-7a70-309e-a2d1-2d2f6085adbd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d70cbdda75da3f258118a558c087157e073229fb <a18a6b93a2843b9d103d3456bbd4b3f90282a379"}, {"id": "bfb09e1f-df46-3a39-80c8-87748c2ac10f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.111"}, {"id": "c672e8b4-9a8e-3fb0-a0f7-7d4bc5a6c245", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.19"}, {"id": "c684d158-eeb9-3a26-9fe3-f2a3d89f9a4c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d70cbdda75da3f258118a558c087157e073229fb <433d52b196a689b18dcfadc7cf6c784f0e5cc7c9"}, {"id": "e2103be9-2d3f-39ee-943c-fdb9e9641e80", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d70cbdda75da3f258118a558c087157e073229fb <40370f02a1ca3760f8925ffcbe76eb4d91ea758d"}, {"id": "fb1e86c9-d3ca-34f0-8343-e551c5088c23", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d70cbdda75da3f258118a558c087157e073229fb <36b9cdab44848f25879ca625275c92b007f84653"}, {"id": "fe2e4d8b-8824-3528-a343-bd9cc2064cd1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "2ae4b98b-f32c-34dd-a855-09262002e960", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}